{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>近年轉戰商界發展的廖碧兒（Bernice），紅酒及精品咖啡事業蒸蒸日上。經常在社交平台分享生活點滴的她，日前上載了一段短片，畫面中蔚藍的天空突然出現了巨型心形圖案以及英文字母「B」（廖碧兒英文名首字母）</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">似乎意為「I Love B」，向廖碧兒「示愛」，引發網民熱討。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"578668ee-b142-4af7-a06c-7ca7a4ed3d13.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20264shOCzA8Ve1787798123.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"578668ee-b142-4af7-a06c-7ca7a4ed3d13.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>片中戴著黑超的廖碧兒心情極佳，對著鏡頭笑容滿面地嬌嗔問道：「邊個咁浪漫，喺天空上面寫Love B？邊個Love B呀？係咪你呀？係咪你Love Me？」 對於這幕突如其來的景象，不少網民推測是有人為她特別安排的浪漫驚喜，但亦有部分網民認為該奇景大概只是屬於 AI 特效。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"bec3ab4b-a631-4f8e-896e-51f4670babb0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Iirc4qRCMK1787798123.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"bec3ab4b-a631-4f8e-896e-51f4670babb0.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0bc51c4c-3b0c-4509-9697-842661c2044c.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026GXPoBtT0GH1787798123.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0bc51c4c-3b0c-4509-9697-842661c2044c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_b916272dbf852f3e-2434\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>廖碧兒的感情動向一直是外界關注的焦點。早前有報導指她與70歲富商呂禮章疑過從甚密，並傳出緋聞。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_b916272dbf852f3e-2434\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T03:20:16.798853+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}